{"id":"n53094-1-10","stage":2,"title":"똥 · 粪便","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53094-1-10-1","ko":"금방이라도 똥이 나올 것만 같아.","zh":"感觉马上就要拉出来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"금방이라도","meaning":"马上，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立马；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"2","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방이라도","audio":"/audio/32cb63beaa72712a8d1e.mp3"}},{"text":"똥이","meaning":"粪便，屎","explanation":"똥：粪便，屎；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"똥","audio":"/audio/83a55b3c18cd4f741522.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53094","senseId":"1","lemma":"똥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"똥이","audio":"/audio/cc3a37270ae7451c2aac.mp3"}},{"text":"나올","meaning":"流出，漏出，涌出","explanation":"나오다：流出，漏出，涌出；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"9","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나올","audio":"/audio/ad9e4b1f57824c9990f8.mp3"}},{"text":"것만","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것만","audio":"/audio/4c07bfddceb1af942fc3.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"就现在，立刻。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"83a55b3c18cd4f74","term":"똥","zh":"粪便，屎","audio":"/audio/83a55b3c18cd4f741522.mp3","entryId":"53094","definition":"人或动物吃的食物消化后排出体外的，散发异味的残渣物。","pronunciation":["똥"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"流出，漏出，涌出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"液体或气体等从里面流到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e1bb16185126065f13c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53094-1-10-2","ko":"화장실은 저쪽이야. 얼른 가!","zh":"厕所在那边，快去！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화장실은","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장실은","audio":"/audio/455e3481e04ee898d5d3.mp3"}},{"text":"저쪽이야.","meaning":"那边","explanation":"저쪽：那边；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"저쪽","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75761","senseId":"1","lemma":"저쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저쪽이야","audio":"/audio/e4bc0e645a9c96db1fcd.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地。","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"가!","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"db084e1f145d7643","term":"저쪽","zh":"那边","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3","entryId":"75761","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人远的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["저쪽"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4def7af4215e86dc960b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53094","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":73,"sequenceScore":2.0027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["厕所在那边，快去！","治疗的时候有点疼吧？","感觉马上就要拉出来了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["厕所在那边，快去！","感觉马上就要拉出来了。","治疗的时候有点疼吧？"],"answer":0}]}
